<title>SWEDEN: TENNIS-DAVIS CUP FINAL COLLATED RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-DAVIS CUP FINAL COLLATED RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>MALMO, Sweden 1996-12-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Collated results from this</p>
<p>weekend's Davis Cup final between Sweden and France:</p>
<p>Friday</p>
<p>Cedric Pioline (France) beat Stefan Edberg (Sweden) 6-3 6-4 6-3</p>
<p>Thomas Enqvist (Sweden) beat Arnaud Boetsch (France) 6-4 6-3</p>
<p>7-6</p>
<p>(7-2)</p>
<p>Saturday</p>
<p>Guy Forget/Guillaume Raoux (France) beat Jonas Bjorkman/Nicklas</p>
<p>Kulti (Sweden) 6-3 1-6 6-3 6-3</p>
<p>Sunday</p>
<p>Thomas Enqvist (Sweden) beat Cedric Pioline (France) 3-6 6-7</p>
<p>(8-10) 6-4 6-4 9-7</p>
<p>Arnaud Boetsch (France) beat Nicklas Kulti (Sweden) 7-6 (7-2)</p>
<p>2-6 4-6 7-6 (7-5) 10-8</p>
<p>France win 3-2</p>
</text>
